//! Raw FFI bindings to [libghostty-vt](https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty),
//! Ghostty's terminal emulation library.
//!
//! The bindings are generated by bindgen from `<ghostty/vt.h>`, and the library
//! is built from the bundled `ghostty` submodule with Zig and linked
//! statically. C enums are exposed as `c_int` type aliases with one constant per
//! value (for example [`GHOSTTY_SUCCESS`]). See the C headers for the API
//! contract of each function.

#![no_std]
#![allow(non_upper_case_globals, non_camel_case_types, non_snake_case)]
#![allow(rustdoc::all)]

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/bindings.rs"));
